  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You animate the forces of your spells into summoned creatures.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may spontaneously convert any spell with an elemental descriptor (such as (fire) or (earth) into a summon monster spell of equal level. However, the only creatures that can be summoned are elementals whose type matches the descriptor (for example, a wizard could convert a fireball into a summon monster III spell used to summon 1d3 small fire elementals).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
